{"v":4,"catch":"向前！ 前往魔法漩渦射擊區！","desc":"\"BLACK HEART \"是UPL在1991年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n黑暗勢力的絕對統治者Taranith綁架了Jeanne。 Zil必須騎上他的龍，飛上天空，襲擊敵人的城堡來救她。\n為了打敗老闆，要與陪伴你的仙女和小精靈合作，當你收集到這些小精靈時，可以發射強大的F・BREATH攻擊。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-11-04","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1768fa36b47b05d6d67db9fc2a6f85f7cad084224f6aa8b89f133acd4de3fb78.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8279ec180d2f7ce6baafd41a4957b107edea423ecd1302a2fc5c9bd04a9c5c6b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3aa4f74f698ab7883fbd90916c8d27e463ccf22e84d3c5c05180e60f54fa8a4c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8bed1ae20e6f3a8c51cb38b99712b64cfb0859b8c8f0c361d5e751e24ee0d178.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/979227054689836256786d06792ef2aa72e09b52f2dd44c8574f0639af3b0b80.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/778b9ac4d78c05ded92803e0e3e183b52e074f67950f72eac1be4fd281fcc97f.jpg"],"titleId":"010015e015676000","dlc":[]}